<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54272" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακρημν-ίζω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Carm.Pop.</u>
					46.33
				</span></i>
			: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρημνός</span>):—<i>throw
				down a precipice</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Ir.</u>
					p.56
				</span></i>
			 W., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.825b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				4.29
			</span></i>: with a word added, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τοῦ ἄκρου τοῦ κρημνοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ch.</u>
					25.12
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.327
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, etc.: pf.
			part., <i>having fallen over a precipice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.3.41
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>throw headlong down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τριηρέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					2.1.31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τῶν ἵππων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.116.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τοῦ πύργου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					4.31
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.4.7
			</span></i>.</div>
